{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15731","headline":"拟百劳歌 · 司空曙","name":"拟百劳歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朱丝纽弦金点杂，双蔕芙蓉共开合。\n谁家稚女着罗裳，红粉青眉娇暮妆。\n木难作牀牙作席，云母屏风光照壁。\n玉颜年几新上头，回身敛笑多自羞。\n红销月落不复见，可惜当时谁拂面。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空曙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15731.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15731","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}